  "description": "A .NET 10 redistribution of the International Components for Unicode (ICU) version 77 native binaries for Windows, packaged for the CodeBrix family. Ships icuuc77.dll + icudt77.dll for win-x64 and win-arm64, the full ICU 77 data archive (icudt.dat), and a buildTransitive .targets pair that delivers the data archive at consumer-build time - embedded as an EmbeddedResource into an application head, or copied beside the application for a host-free consumer such as a test project or a console tool.",
